/*
 * Declares the CmpBoolOperatorValue class.
 *
 * CmpBoolOperatorValue represents binary comparison operations applied to two
 * boolean operands. Boolean comparisons are limited in scope: since booleans
 * have only two possible values, the only meaningful comparisons are equality
 * and inequality. The result of any such comparison is always a boolean.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::binary::bool_::cmp
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/binary/bool_/cmp.yr
